# a registry that agrees with everything, read whole
$ skills validate --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
registry and manifest aligned (4 skills)
skills/ on disk matches overlay.manifest (4 files)
global skill approvals verified (3 skills: 3 approved, 0 grandfathered)
--- stderr ---

# the same, with a key at its root that the reader does not know
$ skills validate --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
warning: registry fields left unread: line 1: unknown top-level key "extra"
error: skills: the registry has fields this program does not read, and validate cannot vouch for a registry it read in part: line 1: unknown top-level key "extra"

# and list, which only reads, warns and goes on
$ skills list
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
alpha	custom	overlay-only	claude,opencode
beta	core	vendor-merge	claude,opencode,codex,pi
ext-one	external	overlay-only	claude
tidy-notes	custom	overlay-only	claude,pi
--- stderr ---
warning: registry fields left unread: line 1: unknown top-level key "extra"

# two keys the reader does not know: the first is named, and how many more
$ skills validate --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
